# Packages installed into the BUILDER's own root ("/") before the target emerge.
#
# Not part of the image. These are packages that a target package needs at *configure*
# time, but that Gentoo declares in RDEPEND only. With a normal ROOT=/ install the
# distinction is invisible — RDEPEND lands in / like everything else — so upstream never
# notices. In this pipeline's two-root emerge (plan/02) RDEPEND goes to $TARGET while the
# compile still happens against "/", so meson/pkg-config cannot see them and configure dies.
#
# Add an entry only with the failing configure line to justify it.

